y-id "q-13953" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot 4-2\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,6\\,|=6\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-13953/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-13953"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-69945/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "ffdf18dc-6e95-5eaa-b6b7-80bf11333fb3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69945/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "a653eba0-aa58-53fe-8498-6bf12f7186ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69945/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "52468d88-cd6f-5527-8669-ca5436796e4f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69945/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "2edf24c0-1d73-55e0-b837-d69547f8b263" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69945/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "342a9db8-ede7-53d2-b5